strawwu-minimal — StrawWU minimal system meta package (W6-B5)

Replaces ubuntu-minimal on StrawWU live and installed systems.

Key differences from ubuntu-minimal:
  - No Depends on ubuntu-pro-client or ubuntu-advantage
  - Conflicts with ubuntu-minimal to prevent dual meta installs
  - Ships meta-audit-manifest.yaml for ubuntu-* allowlist enforcement

See docs/plans/strawwu-ubuntu-components-plan.md and W6-B5 meta audit.
